From 133b94d19fdfe4962c128a5376a01f7ddddbe324 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Volodymyr Pavlenko <pavlenko.vv@pm.me>
Date: Wed, 4 Mar 2026 15:11:07 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] agent: ApAutoConfigurationTask: match BSS reconfig by VAP
 type

Carry VAP type end-to-end and use it to match incoming M2 BSS configs to
existing BSS entries during reconfiguration.

This avoids similarity-based matching and keeps local VAP type stable while
normalizing incoming configs (reuse teardown BSS entries when possible).

Closes PPM-3542

Signed-off-by: Volodymyr Pavlenko <pavlenko.vv@pm.me>
Signed-off-by: Stephan Raj Ignatious Durairaj <signatio@qti.qualcomm.com>
